{
  "markdown": "top of page\n\nSkip to Main Content\n\n## Jacky Casey    Sales Manager\n\n![unnamed.jpg](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_bf4d302c8c794f979e536e9feb45b960~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_205,h_301,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/unnamed.jpg)\n\nHaving over 15 years of administrative experience in the corporate and local government sectors, I bring a wide range of knowledge and skills including travel planning, budgeting, business development, operations management and event planning that make me diverse and able to meet a wide range of client needs. Meeting and exceeding expectations and being client-forward and creative are my strong suits.\n\nI am a Texas Native but have a special appreciation for the beautiful state of California as I have lived there as well. I have one daughter that just started her Freshman year of college in San Diego and two small dogs that I consider my children as well. I enjoy traveling, paddle boarding, upcycling projects and enjoy watching sports. Having become a new empty nester I am excited to focus more time on growing my experience professionally and learning new things!\n\n[![REACH logo](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_b6659293240c40db888d813137f151bc~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_240,h_100,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Reach%20Logo%20jpg.jpg)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/)\n\nbottom of page",
